cl inlines Plain's destructor away and elides the placement `??3@YAXPEAX0@Z` the case declares for the oracle's sake, and names its own `__empty_global_delete` helper; the allocation names this case is about - `??2Base@@SAPEAX_K@Z`, `??3Der@@SAXPEAX@Z`, `??3NV@@SAXPEAX@Z` and the rest - agree, as operator-new.nocl records for the same shapes.
